  "sideNote": "the inner pages sections (.group-content) lay a light paper texture under their words: under a dark system the words turn light and read 1.77:1 on the paper (About us under Moxie, inner pages measured 14/10/2026), so a dark system drops the texture and its own ground shows; the article page lead picture bleeds 160px past the text column on each side (.t3-content.col-xs-12 .item-page figure, at 992px and wider): under a system with a wider container it ran past the window, 84px of sideways scroll under Stripe (visual review 14/10/2026). Under a system the bleed is capped at the window edge (never wider than the template, none below 992px), on both sides",
  "contractNotes1317": "13/10/2026 (#1317): .acm-features.style-1.bg-primary as a brand fill took Moxie accent and its words came out black on #1e1e1e (12 texts, 1.18:1); as an ink fill it takes the system ink and the words the system sets on it. Round 4 (14/10): the news carousel's dots (.category-slide-view .owl-dot, black and #222 rings set !important by the template) take the system's border, the active one its accent: under Stripe on a phone they were 8 of the 19 left paints, and the page followed 84.8%.",
  "reviewV8Note": "15/10/2026 (look review v8): under a dark system the about page’s counter digits turned light over the cream brush picture behind them (.num-pro): the picture is dropped there, as the paper texture already is",
  "dot3Note": "19/10/2026 (dot 3, probe v10, from the published 1.0.6): the header caret paints only its top side (SHAPE-1); header and footer hovers, the active menu item, the footer rule and the counters' hover read the band's accent (ACCENT-LEAK, hover sweep 0 under Moxie, Figma, Mailchimp, Dribbble); the call band .bg-primary is the system's accent band (it read the surface role and turned pale); the counters section and the Donate - Green bands are kept by their section ids (#Section128, #Section95) and .bg-brown like .bg-blue; the hero brush strokes go grey, the counters' brush blobs and the user-page title brushes drop (brand-blue pictures); status buttons, labels, alerts, panels and the typography swatches take the system's surface and status words; contact social buttons, list and pill actives take the accent; faces: h5/h6/.h1-.h4/legend headings, code mono, buttons, menus and footer titles the system's; button corners the system's; the footer subscribe arrow stays an arrow (filtered light), the slideshow ground under the photos is transparent. Left for a template release: the subscribe control is 12px on the template's own page (CLIP-1 template-cut-label), the Donate - Green/Orange slideshow embeds a YouTube video YouTube no longer serves (PREV-1), Tagged Items answers 500 on Joomla 6 (formbehavior.chosen in the com_tags override), the passkey icon is unsized (160px): fixed in joomlart-products feat/ds-dot3-b, not released (a re-cut must pass the VARS-1 role scan first)"
